     <p class="cs-tagline">"Right Here, Right Now."</p>
     <p class="cs-desc">Film direction and production for Ruinart's Carte Blanche 2022, following Danish artist Jeppe Hein from the Maison's vineyards and chalk cellars to the multi-sensory installation "Right Here, Right Now."</p>
   </div>
-</header><div class="cs-media-full"><div class="cs-video-embed"><iframe src="https://www.youtube.com/embed/XMUFIYSwZKs" title="Ruinart x Jeppe Hein" allow="accelerometer; autoplay; clipboard-write; encrypted-media; gyroscope; picture-in-picture" allowfullscreen loading="lazy"></iframe></div></div><div class="cs-intro"><p>Each year Ruinart hands its Carte Blanche to an artist for a fresh interpretation of the Maison's history and savoir-faire. For 2022, Danish artist Jeppe Hein translated his visit to Ruinart's vineyards, bottling plant and chalk cellars in Reims into a short film series and a participatory installation.</p><p>Direction and production followed Hein through the vineyards and cellars, capturing the textures, colours and rituals that became the raw material for "Right Here, Right Now". A piece built around the four elements at the heart of champagne making.</p></div><div class="cs-strategy">
+</header><div class="cs-media-full"><div class="cs-video-embed"><video controls poster="/assets/ruinart/ruinart-film-XMUFIYSwZKs-poster.jpg" preload="metadata"><source src="/assets/ruinart/ruinart-film-XMUFIYSwZKs.mp4" type="video/mp4"></video></div></div><div class="cs-intro"><p>Each year Ruinart hands its Carte Blanche to an artist for a fresh interpretation of the Maison's history and savoir-faire. For 2022, Danish artist Jeppe Hein translated his visit to Ruinart's vineyards, bottling plant and chalk cellars in Reims into a short film series and a participatory installation.</p><p>Direction and production followed Hein through the vineyards and cellars, capturing the textures, colours and rituals that became the raw material for "Right Here, Right Now". A piece built around the four elements at the heart of champagne making.</p></div><div class="cs-strategy">
   <span class="cs-section-label">01 — Right Here, Right Now</span>
   <div class="cs-strategy-intro">
     <h2>A film built around the senses.</h2>
